; A fixture for the test suite, not a level: the stage-1 room as it was before the
; blockout became an island (ADR-0034) — one room, a balcony over its right half, a
; flight of stairs two cells wide — kept so that the tests of how the snake, the bots
; and the camera behave do not change with every change to the shipped map.
; Every grid row is exactly 24 cells wide; a space is a cell with no module.
; The partition that stood in column 10, row 4, is gone: a partition is thin across the rows, and
; with the one below it made a slot 0.4 m wide, narrower than the snake (FR-MAP-260).
; The row under the flight's taller steps is wall: a single row of floor between the flight's
; side and the south wall was a gap narrower than the snake (FR-MAP-260).
; The treasure lies in the middle of the room and the evacuation point in its south-east
; corner (FR-MAP-290), sixteen steps apart: a fixture short enough for a test to play out.

kit blockout
setting greenholm
spawn 1,1 0
treasure 12,7 0
evacuation 21,14 0

